    {
        "content": "<p>I define :</p>\n<p>inductive MyEq13  : Nat → Nat → Prop where<br>\n  | refl (a : Nat) : MyEq13 a a</p>\n<p>And I consider the following proof :</p>\n<p>theorem t8 : ∀ {a b : Nat}, MyEq13 a b → a = b :=<br>\nfun {a b} h =&gt;<br>\n  match b, h with<br>\n  | .(a), MyEq13.refl a =&gt; Eq.refl a</p>\n<p>How can I change the proof such that match is not used and also neither tactics nor rfl are used ?</p>",
